1m11|a|Bending forward; inclined; not erect. ; Prostrate; flat; esp., lying with the face down; -- opposed to supine. ; Headlong; running downward or headlong. ; Sloping, with reference to a line or surface; declivous; inclined; not level. ; Inclined; propense; disposed; -- applied to the mind or affections, usually in an ill sense. Followed by to.	e:15u7,55,5;1awf,36,7;2753,35,4~1awf,36,7;15u7,55,5;2753,35,4
